<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Peter Kenilorea</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1943">1943</a>–<a href="/years/2016">2016</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sir Peter Kenilorea was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/solomon">Solomon</a> Islands teacher and politician who became chief minister in 1976 and the first prime minister when the islands became independent from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> on 7 July 1978. He served as prime minister again in the mid-1980s and later as speaker of the national parliament.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/peter-kenilorea.jpg" alt="Peter Kenilorea" width="320" height="390" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Jenny Scott from Adelaide, Australia · CC BY 2.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peter_Kenilorea_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>A legislative council and self-government followed, and the islands became independent as Solomon Islands on 7 July 1978, with <b>Peter Kenilorea</b> as prime minister.</blockquote><a href="/state/british-solomon-islands-protectorate">British Solomon Islands Protectorate</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malaita">Malaita</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/honiara">Honiara</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=-9,161&amp;year=1990" aria-label="Malaita on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="8996 2500 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Peter Kenilorea"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M9446 2770h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M9446 2770h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=-9,161&amp;year=1990">What was here in 1990? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
